Thus begins the tale of hero:
Let the queen, a whole number, become zero.
Do this 15 times:
Let the queen now be the sum of one and the queen.
If the remainder of the queen and 15 is zero, then:
Proclaim "FizzBuzz, my hero".
Otherwise:
If the remainder of the queen and 3 is zero, then:
Proclaim "Fizz, my hero".
Otherwise:
If the remainder of the queen and 5 is zero, then:
Proclaim "Buzz, my hero".
Otherwise:
Proclaim the text of the queen.
So be it.
So be it.
So be it.
So be it.
Proclaim "Sing it, so serene".
